  "steps": [
    "Soak the soya chunks in hot water for 10 minutes, then squeeze out the water completely and set aside.",
    "Heat the oil in a pan, add the cumin seeds, then the onion and cook until golden brown.",
    "Add the ginger garlic paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato puree with turmeric, chilli powder, coriander powder and salt and cook until the oil separates.",
    "Add the soya chunks and sauté for 2 minutes, then pour in the water.",
    "Cover and simmer for 12-15 minutes until the gravy thickens and the chunks are soft.",
    "Stir in the garam masala and coriander leaves."
  ]
